{"unit_id": "tag:01PD:prose-0004", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n设<MATH_0001>为概形（scheme）。下述引理（lemma）用到<TEXTITOPEN_0001>拟凝聚（quasi-coherent）<MATH_0002>-代数（algebra）<MATH_0003>为有限型（finite type）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>这一概念。这意味着，对每个仿射开集（affine open）<MATH_0004>，都有<MATH_0005>，其中<MATH_0006>是一个（交换（commutative））<MATH_0007>-代数（algebra），并且是有限型（finite type）的<MATH_0008>-代数（algebra）。\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "lemma", "target_term": "引理"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚"}, {"source_term": "algebra", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "finite type", "target_term": "有限型"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开集"}, {"source_term": "commutative", "target_term": "交换"}, {"source_term": "algebra", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "finite type", "target_term": "有限型"}, {"source_term": "algebra", "target_term": "代数"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "作为定义背景的几何对象"}, {"source_term": "lemma", "target_term": "引理", "context": "指下文使用该概念的命题"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚", "context": "修饰所定义的层代数"}, {"source_term": "algebra", "target_term": "代数", "context": "指所定义的层代数"}, {"source_term": "finite type", "target_term": "有限型", "context": "指层代数的有限生成性质"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开集", "context": "检验条件所用的仿射开子集"}, {"source_term": "commutative", "target_term": "交换", "context": "限定局部代数的乘法"}, {"source_term": "algebra", "target_term": "代数", "context": "指在仿射开集上出现的局部代数"}, {"source_term": "finite type", "target_term": "有限型", "context": "指局部代数在给定底环上的有限生成性质"}, {"source_term": "algebra", "target_term": "代数", "context": "指判定有限型时所取的底环代数结构"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:05JT:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>为概形（scheme）。假设<MATH_0002>是拟紧（quasi-compact）且拟分离（quasi-separated）的。设<MATH_0003>为拟凝聚（quasi-coherent）<MATH_0004>-代数（algebra）。则<MATH_0005>是一个有向余极限（directed colimit），所取的是它的各有限型（finite type）拟凝聚（quasi-coherent）<MATH_0006>-子代数（subalgebras）。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "拟紧"}, {"source_term": "quasi-separated", "target_term": "拟分离"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚"}, {"source_term": "algebra", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "directed colimit", "target_term": "有向余极限"}, {"source_term": "finite type", "target_term": "有限型"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚"}, {"source_term": "subalgebras", "target_term": "子代数"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "引理中给定的几何对象"}, {"source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "拟紧", "context": "引理对概形的第一项假设"}, {"source_term": "quasi-separated", "target_term": "拟分离", "context": "引理对概形的第二项假设"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚", "context": "修饰给定的层代数"}, {"source_term": "algebra", "target_term": "代数", "context": "引理中给定的层代数"}, {"source_term": "directed colimit", "target_term": "有向余极限", "context": "由这些子代数得到原代数的构造"}, {"source_term": "finite type", "target_term": "有限型", "context": "限定构成系统的子代数"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚", "context": "限定构成系统的子代数"}, {"source_term": "subalgebras", "target_term": "子代数", "context": "构成有向系统的子对象"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:05JT:proof", "translation": "若<MATH_0001>是拟凝聚（quasi-coherent）<MATH_0002>-子代数（subalgebras），且为有限型（finite type），那么<MATH_0003>的像（image）也是拟凝聚（quasi-coherent）<MATH_0004>-子代数（subalgebra），且为有限型（finite type）（略去一些细节），并且同时包含<MATH_0005>和<MATH_0006>。由此可见，这个系统（system）是有向（directed）的。为了证明<MATH_0007>是这个系统（system）的余极限（colimit），将<MATH_0008>写成一个有向余极限（directed colimit），其中各项均为有限表示（finitely presented）的拟凝聚（quasi-coherent）<MATH_0009>-代数（algebras），如引理（Lemma）<REF_0001>所述。于是，像（images）<MATH_0010>都是<MATH_0011>的拟凝聚（quasi-coherent）子代数（subalgebras），且均为有限型（finite type）。由于<MATH_0012>是它们的余极限（colimit），结论随即成立。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚"}, {"source_term": "subalgebras", "target_term": "子代数"}, {"source_term": "finite type", "target_term": "有限型"}, {"source_term": "image", "target_term": "像"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚"}, {"source_term": "subalgebra", "target_term": "子代数"}, {"source_term": "finite type", "target_term": "有限型"}, {"source_term": "system", "target_term": "系统"}, {"source_term": "directed", "target_term": "有向"}, {"source_term": "system", "target_term": "系统"}, {"source_term": "colimit", "target_term": "余极限"}, {"source_term": "directed colimit", "target_term": "有向余极限"}, {"source_term": "finitely presented", "target_term": "有限表示"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚"}, {"source_term": "algebras", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "Lemma", "target_term": "引理"}, {"source_term": "images", "target_term": "像"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚"}, {"source_term": "subalgebras", "target_term": "子代数"}, {"source_term": "finite type", "target_term": "有限型"}, {"source_term": "colimit", "target_term": "余极限"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚", "context": "限定起初选取的子代数"}, {"source_term": "subalgebras", "target_term": "子代数", "context": "用来证明有向性的两个对象"}, {"source_term": "finite type", "target_term": "有限型", "context": "限定起初选取的子代数"}, {"source_term": "image", "target_term": "像", "context": "用来构造共同上界的像"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚", "context": "限定所得的像子代数"}, {"source_term": "subalgebra", "target_term": "子代数", "context": "作为共同上界得到的子对象"}, {"source_term": "finite type", "target_term": "有限型", "context": "限定所得的像子代数"}, {"source_term": "system", "target_term": "系统", "context": "由有限型拟凝聚子代数构成"}, {"source_term": "directed", "target_term": "有向", "context": "由共同上界得出的系统性质"}, {"source_term": "system", "target_term": "系统", "context": "所求余极限对应的子代数系统"}, {"source_term": "colimit", "target_term": "余极限", "context": "要证明与给定代数相等的构造"}, {"source_term": "directed colimit", "target_term": "有向余极限", "context": "由所引引理得到的表示"}, {"source_term": "finitely presented", "target_term": "有限表示", "context": "限定该表示中的各代数"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚", "context": "限定该表示中的各代数"}, {"source_term": "algebras", "target_term": "代数", "context": "该有向余极限中的各项"}, {"source_term": "Lemma", "target_term": "引理", "context": "所用有向余极限表示的出处"}, {"source_term": "images", "target_term": "像", "context": "从该表示取得的各像"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚", "context": "限定这些像子代数"}, {"source_term": "subalgebras", "target_term": "子代数", "context": "这些像在给定代数中的结构"}, {"source_term": "finite type", "target_term": "有限型", "context": "限定这些像子代数"}, {"source_term": "colimit", "target_term": "余极限", "context": "用于得出结论的各像的余极限"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01PD:prose-0005", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n设<MATH_0001>为概形（scheme）。下述引理（lemma）用到<TEXTITOPEN_0001>有限（finite）（相应地，<SPACE_0001>整（integral））的拟凝聚（quasi-coherent）<MATH_0002>-代数（algebra）<MATH_0003><TEXTITCLOSE_0001>这一概念。这意味着，对每个仿射开集（affine open）<MATH_0004>，都有<MATH_0005>，其中<MATH_0006>是一个（交换（commutative））<MATH_0007>-代数（algebra），并且是有限（finite）（相应地，<SPACE_0002>整（integral））的<MATH_0008>-代数（algebra）。\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "lemma", "target_term": "引理"}, {"source_term": "finite", "target_term": "有限"}, {"source_term": "integral", "target_term": "整"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚"}, {"source_term": "algebra", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开集"}, {"source_term": "commutative", "target_term": "交换"}, {"source_term": "algebra", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "finite", "target_term": "有限"}, {"source_term": "integral", "target_term": "整"}, {"source_term": "algebra", "target_term": "代数"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "作为定义背景的几何对象"}, {"source_term": "lemma", "target_term": "引理", "context": "指下文使用该概念的命题"}, {"source_term": "finite", "target_term": "有限", "context": "所定义的层代数的第一种性质"}, {"source_term": "integral", "target_term": "整", "context": "所定义的层代数的第二种性质"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚", "context": "修饰所定义的层代数"}, {"source_term": "algebra", "target_term": "代数", "context": "指所定义的层代数"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开集", "context": "检验条件所用的仿射开子集"}, {"source_term": "commutative", "target_term": "交换", "context": "限定局部代数的乘法"}, {"source_term": "algebra", "target_term": "代数", "context": "指在仿射开集上出现的局部代数"}, {"source_term": "finite", "target_term": "有限", "context": "指局部代数在给定底环上作为模有限生成"}, {"source_term": "integral", "target_term": "整", "context": "指局部代数在给定底环上具有整性"}, {"source_term": "algebra", "target_term": "代数", "context": "指判定有