{"unit_id": "tag:086N:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>为概形（scheme）。假设<MATH_0002>是拟紧（quasi-compact）且拟分离（quasi-separated）的。设<MATH_0003>为有限（finite）的拟凝聚（quasi-coherent）<MATH_0004>-代数（algebra）。则<MATH_0005>是一个有向余极限（directed colimit），其各项为有限（finite）且有限表示（finitely presented）的拟凝聚（quasi-coherent）<MATH_0006>-代数（algebras），且所有过渡映射（transition maps）<MATH_0007>都是满射（surjective）。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "拟紧"}, {"source_term": "quasi-separated", "target_term": "拟分离"}, {"source_term": "finite", "target_term": "有限"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚"}, {"source_term": "algebra", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "directed colimit", "target_term": "有向余极限"}, {"source_term": "finite", "target_term": "有限"}, {"source_term": "finitely presented", "target_term": "有限表示"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚"}, {"source_term": "algebras", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "transition maps", "target_term": "过渡映射"}, {"source_term": "surjective", "target_term": "满射"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "引理中给定的几何对象"}, {"source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "拟紧", "context": "引理对概形的第一项假设"}, {"source_term": "quasi-separated", "target_term": "拟分离", "context": "引理对概形的第二项假设"}, {"source_term": "finite", "target_term": "有限", "context": "给定层代数的有限性假设"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚", "context": "修饰给定的层代数"}, {"source_term": "algebra", "target_term": "代数", "context": "引理中给定的层代数"}, {"source_term": "directed colimit", "target_term": "有向余极限", "context": "引理给出的层代数表示"}, {"source_term": "finite", "target_term": "有限", "context": "该表示中各项具有的第一种性质"}, {"source_term": "finitely presented", "target_term": "有限表示", "context": "该表示中各项具有的第二种性质"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚", "context": "修饰该表示中的各项"}, {"source_term": "algebras", "target_term": "代数", "context"